[{"id":2676178015,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6fgzxf","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"That's good enough for me!\r\n\r\nI only skimmed the changes, but with this kind of change I concur that any mistakes are likely caught by the compiler.\r\n\r\nThe only caveat I could think of was that, by removing the constructors from the cpp files, callers would be forced to create the objects in-place, instead of being able to hand this off to the module. This would save a call, but create more inline code (at least in non LTO builds).\r\n\r\nI made a quick sanity check of file sizes of the action in this build, and there doesn't seem to be any real observable difference (40 bytes in the iOS build).\r\n\r\nSo yea, lgtm!","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103988#pullrequestreview-2676178015","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103988","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103988#pullrequestreview-